{"speciesId":297,"names":{"fr":"Hariyama","es":"Hariyama","en":"Hariyama","ja":"ハリテヤマ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"HARIYAMA practices its straight-arm slaps in any number of locations. One hit of this POKéMON’s powerful, openhanded, straight-arm punches could snap a telephone pole in two."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"HARIYAMA’s thick body may appear fat, but it is actually a hunk of solid muscle. If this POKéMON bears down and tightens all its muscles, its body becomes as hard as a rock."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It has the habit of challenging others without hesitation to tests of strength. It’s been known to stand on train tracks and stop trains using forearm thrusts."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It stomps on the ground to build power. It can send a 10-ton truck flying with a straight-arm punch."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It stomps on the ground to build power. It can send a 10-ton truck flying with a straight-arm punch."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It loves to match power with big-bodied Pokémon. It can knock a truck flying with its arm thrusts."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It loves to match power with big-bodied Pokémon. It can knock a truck flying with its arm thrusts."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It loves to match power with big-bodied Pokémon. It can knock a truck flying with its arm thrusts."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It loves challenging others to tests of strength. It has the power to stop a train with a slap."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It loves challenging others to tests of strength. It has the power to stop a train with a slap."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il aime mesurer sa force à celle des plus grands Pokémon. Ses coups de paume peuvent projeter un camion."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It loves to match power with big-bodied Pokémon. It can knock a truck flying with its arm thrusts."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il aime mesurer sa force à celle des plus grands Pokémon. Ses coups de paume peuvent projeter un camion."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It loves to match power with big-bodied Pokémon. It can knock a truck flying with its arm thrusts."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It loves to match power with big-bodied Pokémon. It can knock a truck flying with its arm thrusts."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It loves to match power with big-bodied Pokémon. It can knock a truck flying with its arm thrusts."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il piétine le sol violemment pour concentrer son énergie. Il peut envoyer en l’air un camion de 10 t d’un seul coup de poing."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Para aumentar su fuerza, da un pisotón en el suelo. Puede lanzar un camión de 10 toneladas por los aires de un puñetazo."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It stomps on the ground to build power. It can send a 10-ton truck flying with a straight-arm punch."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"両足で 地面を 踏み鳴らして パワーを ためる。張り手 １発で １０トン トラックを 吹っ飛ばす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il aime mesurer sa force à celle des plus grands Pokémon. Ses coups de paume peuvent projeter un camion."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Le encanta enfrentarse a Pokémon grandes y probar su fuerza. Sus brazos pueden derribar un camión."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It loves to match power with big-bodied Pokémon. It can knock a truck flying with its arm thrusts."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"体の 大きな ポケモンたちと 力比べをすることが 大好き。 張り手で トラックを ぶっ飛ばす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Hariyama s’entraîne à donner ses coups directs avec sa paume le plus souvent possible. Un seul de ces puissants coups de paume peut plier un poteau téléphonique en deux."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Hariyama practica los empujones que da estirando los brazos allá por donde va. Este Pokémon puede partir por la mitad un poste de teléfono de un enérgico golpe con los brazos estirados y las manos abiertas."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Hariyama practices its straight-arm slaps in any number of locations. One hit of this Pokémon’s powerful, openhanded, straight-arm punches could snap a telephone pole in two."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"色んな 場所で 張り手の けいこに 励む。 強烈な 張り手 攻撃を くらうと 電信柱も 一撃で 真っ二つだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Hariyama a l’air un peu enrobé, mais c’est en fait une montagne de muscles. Si ce Pokémon se raidit et contracte ses muscles, son corps devient dur comme de la pierre."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Puede que parezca que Hariyama está grueso, pero en realidad es una mole de puro músculo. Si este Pokémon hace fuerza y tensa la musculatura, se pone sólido como una roca."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Hariyama’s thick body may appear fat, but it is actually a hunk of solid muscle. If this Pokémon bears down and tightens all its muscles, its body becomes as hard as a rock."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"肥った 体は 筋肉の 塊。 ぐぐっと 全身に 力を 込めると 筋肉は 岩と 同じ 硬さになるぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Malgré leur force spectaculaire, les vieux Hariyama préfèrent délaisser le combat au profit de l’entraînement des jeunes Makuhita."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Los Hariyama veteranos son conocidos por su fuerza descomunal, pero prefieren retirarse de la vida de combate y entrenar a los Makuhita."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It is known for its fantastic strength, but as it grows older, it focuses more on training Makuhita."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"怪力で 知られるが 年老いると 戦うことを やめ マクノシタに 稽古を つけるように なるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Sa force herculéenne lui permet de renverser un camion d’une seule main. Les Hariyama aiment s’adonner à des concours de force pure."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Los Hariyama pueden tumbar un camión dándole un tortazo con la mano abierta. Les encantan las pruebas de fuerza."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"They love to compare their freakish strength— strength enough to send a truck flying with a single slap."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"張り手 一発で トラックを ふっ飛ばすほどの 怪力で 力比べが 大好き。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Bien qu’il aime les rapports de force, c’est aussi un cœur tendre qui sait respecter et féliciter ses adversaires pour leur combativité."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Adora las competiciones de fuerza, pero el respeto y la cortesía hacia sus adversarios son muy importantes para este noble Pokémon."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Although they enjoy comparing their strength, they’re also kind. They value etiquette, praising opponents they battle."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"力比べが 好きだが 優しさも あわせもち 戦った 相手を ねぎらうなど 礼儀を 重んじる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Les Hariyama les plus forts ne sont pas forcément les plus grands. Les petits gabarits aussi ont plus d’un tour dans leur sac."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"No todos los Hariyama son grandotes, recios y fuertes. También los hay de menor tamaño pero mayor agilidad y precisión en los movimientos."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Hariyama that are big and fat aren’t necessarily strong. There are some small ones that move nimbly and use moves skillfully."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"太って 大きな ハリテヤマが 強いとは 限らない。 小柄でも 身軽で 技に 長けたものもいる。"}],"varieties":[{"id":297,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","le